                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty Grpd \hookrightarrow \mathbf{H}_{infinitesimal}\hookrightarrow \mathbf{H}_{th}
            which is
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+cohesion"} infinitesimally cohesive
          %p
            This happens notably for the model of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+smooth+%E2%88%9E-groupoids"} formal smooth ∞-groupoids
            and all its variants such as formal
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+analytic+%E2%88%9E-groupoids"} complex analytic ∞-groupoids
            etc. But in this case
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
