                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\flat \dashv \sharp)
          %p (…)
          #CounitOfFlatRelIsFormallyEtale.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_4 Proposition
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/counit+of+a+comonad"} counit
              of the relative flat modality is a
              = succeed "." do
