                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{H}_{th}
              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+topos"} classifying (∞,1)-topos
              for
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structure+sheaves"} structure sheaves
              and
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi 𝒪
                      %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{O}_X
              in prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#StructureSheafIsIndeedStructureSheaf"}
              may be regarded as the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/inverse+image"} inverse image
              of the classifying
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+morphism"} geometric morphism
            .maruku-equation
